The pre-announcement to the exiles creates a hermeneutical framework. When Jerusalem falls, they cannot comfort themselves with naturalistic explanations. Ezekiel has already provided the lens through which to read events: divine fury at sanctuary defilement.\
The Habakkuk 3:5 connection is particularly revealing - "
\f1 \uc0\u1491 \u1462 \u1468 \u1489 \u1462 \u1512 
